    "detailed_description": "The moon shines as the midnight wind blows through the half-opened window. A stern figure sits in a brown leather chair and lights up a cigar. <br><br>A rustle of newspaper and a gleam in the figure's eye... A new case has presented itself, and it's detective is ready.<br><br>Patty &quot;Pat&quot; Irvin sweeps out of his chair and collects his things. His thirst for solving crime is about to be sated.<br><br><strong><i>What is What?!?</i></strong><br><br>What?! is a single-player mystery game that focuses on its compact story and unconventional solutions. Players will take on the role of Pat Irvin, a ditzy private investigator struggling to maintain his family business.<br><br>Players will have access to four full cases, and an additional tutorial case, with each case evolving upon existing ideas while remaining distinct.<br><br><br><br>Made By: Trevor, Miles, Leena, Joon, Cathy, Darcy, Emily, Yunfei<br><br>Music by @malakazam_<br><br>With special thanks to Justin and Teresa",
